# Ketra Orc support (KetraOrcSupport): the village folk of a Ketra Orc ally of level 5, each first talk answering by the level.
# The ally buys the last blessing for 6 tokens (the soul guide's cast of it is in
# tests/quest/alliance_support_test.go: a scenario civilian has no MP to pay it), and finds the
# warehouse empty. Killing a soldier of the side then breaks the alliance: the level 5 badge
# becomes the level 4 one, the alliance mission ends with its item, and every folk answers a
# player of no alliance.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (KetraOrcSupport.onFirstTalk, onAdvEvent,
# onMyDying) and replay the reference trace.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/ketra_support_ally_5.golden
character Ally 40
standing 5
hold 7215 1
hold 7186 6
hold 7216 3
quest Q605_AllianceWithKetraOrcs <state>=STARTED <cond>=1
stub quest.Q605_AllianceWithKetraOrcs
script script.feature.KetraOrcSupport
item 7215 7214 7186 7216
page script/feature/KetraOrcSupport/
npc kadun 31370 Folk 10 0 0
npc wahkan 31371 Folk 0 10 0
npc asefa 31372 Folk -10 0 0
npc atan 31373 Merchant 0 -10 0
npc jaff 31374 WarehouseKeeper 10 10 0
npc jumara 31375 Merchant -10 -10 0
npc kurfa 31376 Gatekeeper 10 -10 0
npc footman 21324 Monster 40 0 0

